    "reference_policy": "Source-visible baseline; explanation rules later only",
    "task_id": "plane_wave_ultrasound",
    "units": "Raw unsigned 8-bit ADC codes stored float32; not calibrated pressure or IQ. Time seconds, angles radians in solver (degrees in display), pitch metres, c1540m/s. No carrier/wavelength/attenuation/TGC or clinical interpretation verified.",
    "algorithm": "Float64 global DC subtraction per whole phantom; per-angle Stolt migration: signed steering delay, positive frequency FFT, evanescent removal, linear Stolt interpolation, obliquity, conjugate frequency reconstruction, lateral steering phase and IFFT. Complex angle images averaged BEFORE abs(Hilbert(real(compound)))**gamma; gamma fibers .7/cysts .5. No max normalization/log B-mode. No method executed.",
    "geometry": "t0 fibers0/cysts50us; even ntshift=0/1000; ntFFT=10752/7144, nxFFT192. x=(element\u221263.5)*298um; z=n*c/(2fs), relative to acquisition origin despite t0 compensation. Code ERM v(theta0)=c/sqrt2, not README narrative c/2; beta=sqrt2 at0.",
    "metrics": "Source centered Pearson NCC; generic cosine NCC. Source range NRMSE with1e-12 versus generic full reference range. Native data baseline shapes344064/196608 pixels; saved evaluation arrays differ. Generic sole output selects one shape. Task names ncc_fibers_boundary,nrmse_fibers_boundary,ncc_cysts_boundary,nrmse_cysts_boundary are not generic ncc_boundary/nrmse_boundary => absent generic verdict under this metrics schema.",
    "source_quality": "FWHM on power-compressed fibers gamma .7 at8 approximate depths10..80mm: nearest depth row, first argmax, discrete half-maximum crossings, no subpixel fit. CNR on linear envelope (not gamma B-mode):2mm disk,3\u20135mm shell, |mean_in\u2212mean_out|/population_std_outside. Two scripted phantom ROIs, no patient or generic full-array metric equivalent.",
    "scorer_route": "Filesystem generic reference discovery uses data/baseline_reference.npz, whose two (1,Nt,128) arrays squeeze only because ndim>2. Output (2688,128) selects fibers and (1536,128) selects cysts; neither is private anatomical truth. Saved bmode_*.npy filenames lack accepted ground_truth/reference/reconstruction/recon/gt tokens and do not replace that baseline. No-filesystem scorer instead requires generic ground_truth.npy, absent in the pinned tree. Installed phantom-specific metrics keys are not generic ncc_boundary/nrmse_boundary; without both generic keys, passed=None, not a success or failure.",
    "steering_sign_limit": "The source declares positive angle means element0 fires first, while the steering-delay expression sin(theta)*(reference-e)*pitch/c+t0 numerically decreases with element for positive theta. This expression is used for phase compensation; mapping to measured hardware emission times is not independently established. Preserve expression and declared convention without inferring calibration."
